WEBVTT

00:01.668 --> 00:04.337
I'm Nina, 12 years old.

00:04.337 --> 00:08.041
I was just an ordinary
junior high school student, but...

00:08.041 --> 00:11.277
Since the day I accidentally swallowed
a ball called the Crystal Pearl,

00:11.277 --> 00:14.280
my life has changed pretty drastically.

00:14.280 --> 00:19.452
And the ball happened to be something
that's used for the sorcery test.

00:19.452 --> 00:22.255
The team of the two examinees,
which happens to possess that ball

00:22.255 --> 00:24.883
when the test ends, will pass the test
and become professional sorcerers!

00:27.027 --> 00:29.329
Does that mean I'm going to be
chased down by the examinees?!

00:29.329 --> 00:32.232
- Don't cry!
- I guess you have no choice
but to prepare yourself, Zero.

00:32.232 --> 00:33.500
Huh?

00:33.500 --> 00:35.235
There is only one way to do this.

00:35.235 --> 00:36.836
You will have to protect her
with everything you've got

00:36.836 --> 00:39.339
until the day that the test ends.

00:39.339 --> 00:40.640
Until the day the medicine is completed

00:40.640 --> 00:44.210
and you're able to remove
the Crystal Pearl from her body...

00:44.210 --> 00:46.312
We will protect her with our own hands!

00:46.312 --> 00:47.680
You mean her?!

00:47.680 --> 00:51.718
Me? These guys are going to protect me?

00:51.718 --> 00:52.852
Just like the princes

00:52.852 --> 00:55.422
who bravely face the enemies
no matter how ferocious they are

00:55.422 --> 00:58.224
and fight them for the people
that they love and their own dreams...

00:58.224 --> 01:00.988
These two are going to protect me!

01:01.094 --> 01:13.706
One love! Two love? Three love! Four love?
One love! Two love? Three love! Come on!

01:13.706 --> 01:19.979
Here's what boys don't know.
Girls are moody.

01:19.979 --> 01:26.219
You're a sweet person
and it will be okay tomorrow.

01:26.219 --> 01:32.525
But I feel different today.
I want to go all out!

01:32.525 --> 01:38.798
Because I can't decide it just yet
I want everything

01:38.798 --> 01:45.071
The kinds of love are just like jewels.

01:45.071 --> 01:51.344
Each of them (Shining boys!)
is sparkling. Yes!

01:51.344 --> 01:57.650
They say there is only one true love

01:57.650 --> 02:03.957
But it's okay, we can decide
that at the very last moment

02:03.957 --> 02:10.196
That moment (Happiness)
I will protect it (Happiness)

02:10.196 --> 02:16.503
Come on, let's go find a popping heart

02:16.503 --> 02:22.775
My love! True love! Your love! Pure love!
My love! True love! Your love! Pure love!

02:22.775 --> 02:27.542
My love! True love! Your love!
Pure love! My love! True love!

02:32.986 --> 02:35.155
Huh? Everyone seems to be
acting a little strange today.

02:35.155 --> 02:38.992
They're restless for some reason.
What's going on?

02:38.992 --> 02:40.994
Because today is a little special, so...

02:40.994 --> 02:42.154
- Special?
- Special?

02:42.662 --> 02:46.499
The season of our annual
highly anticipated event has come!

02:46.499 --> 02:48.468
Raise your hand
if you want to participate!

02:48.468 --> 02:50.670
Me! Me! Me! Me! Me!

02:50.670 --> 02:51.437
What is this?

02:51.437 --> 02:53.173
We're going to test your courage!

02:53.173 --> 02:56.843
We draw lots then a girl
and a boy pair with each other.

02:56.843 --> 02:58.945
If you confess your love to your partner-

02:58.945 --> 03:02.182
Supposedly you'll be guaranteed to have
a successful relationship with the person!

03:02.182 --> 03:05.518
- I see! That's why everyone was...
- That explains!

03:05.518 --> 03:07.854
Hey, hey, Nina, Nina!

03:07.854 --> 03:09.856
Which one are you going
to confess your love to?

03:09.856 --> 03:11.424
Is it Ichii or Zero?

03:11.424 --> 03:12.692
Which one?

03:12.692 --> 03:14.928
You are going to confess
your love to one of them, right?

03:14.928 --> 03:17.931
Right? Right? You have
to decide it by tonight!

03:17.931 --> 03:19.732
W-Wait a minute!

03:19.732 --> 03:22.535
What am I supposed to do when you
ask me to pick one right away?

03:22.535 --> 03:23.770
It sounds interesting!

03:23.770 --> 03:25.371
We should participate, too!

03:25.371 --> 03:27.006
What?

03:27.006 --> 03:28.208
What?!

03:28.208 --> 03:30.108
I don't know what to do!

03:30.610 --> 03:34.273
"The Summer Event is Super Stimulating!"

03:37.584 --> 03:41.020
Hey, Yakumo, are you
sure it's in this area?

03:41.020 --> 03:44.857
Yeah, I'm sure of it.
This finder said...

03:44.857 --> 03:48.194
It's around here! It's around here!

03:48.194 --> 03:49.362
That's what it said.

03:49.362 --> 03:51.431
But according to the rumor,

03:51.431 --> 03:55.268
some girl has swallowed
the Crystal Pearl.

03:55.268 --> 03:58.938
Are you sure that your
raggedy finder knows where it is?

03:58.938 --> 04:00.974
Why don't you buy
a new one already?

04:00.974 --> 04:02.742
Come on, don't be ridiculous!

04:02.742 --> 04:05.478
Nanase! This may be
a raggedy finder,

04:05.478 --> 04:07.180
but it's a respectable
finder that's been

04:07.180 --> 04:08.715
passed down from my grandfather!

04:08.715 --> 04:12.518
How could I possibly
buy a new one?

04:12.518 --> 04:15.088
Hmm... Is that how it is?

04:15.088 --> 04:17.757
It is not accurate
and always stops working.

04:17.757 --> 04:20.526
I really think it's time
for you to get a new one.

04:20.526 --> 04:21.928
No way!

04:21.928 --> 04:25.431
Both my grandfather and my father
passed the test using this!

04:25.431 --> 04:28.368
So I too will find the
Crystal Pearl using this

04:28.368 --> 04:30.770
and lawfully become
a professional sorcerer!

04:30.770 --> 04:33.940
It must be hard to be the son
and heir of the sorcery dojo!

04:33.940 --> 04:35.942
But I do have to admit
that you're dedicated

04:35.942 --> 04:37.777
and that's what I like about you.

04:37.777 --> 04:40.268
It's around here! It's around...

04:41.581 --> 04:43.283
Sheesh! Don't quit on me,
damn it!

04:43.283 --> 04:45.717
I'm telling you.
You should get a new one.

04:48.454 --> 04:50.790
It's around here! It's around here!

04:50.790 --> 04:52.025
Where is it?

04:52.025 --> 04:53.126
Right here.

04:53.126 --> 04:54.794
It's in this school.

04:54.794 --> 04:58.631
All right, we did it! I found it!
Check it out, Nanase!

04:58.631 --> 05:01.134
From here, the signal of
the Crystal Pearl is...

05:01.134 --> 05:02.669
This school...

05:02.669 --> 05:03.803
Gone!

05:03.803 --> 05:05.305
Okay, Nina, I'll see you later!

05:05.305 --> 05:06.306
Okay!

05:06.306 --> 05:07.307
Huh?

05:07.307 --> 05:08.899
It's gone!

05:09.942 --> 05:11.644
Isn't that because
the girl who's swallowed

05:11.644 --> 05:13.646
the Crystal Pearl has gone home already?

05:13.646 --> 05:15.848
Oh, that must be it, Nanase-chan!

05:15.848 --> 05:18.584
Isn't he an idiot or what?

05:18.584 --> 05:21.054
Nanase! What do you
think you're doing?

05:21.054 --> 05:23.323
Stop being all flirty with all
these dudes at a time like this,

05:23.323 --> 05:25.591
and start thinking about
what we should do!

05:25.591 --> 05:27.860
Hey, what are you going to do
about tonight's courage test?

05:27.860 --> 05:29.662
I'm going! It's going
to be fun, you know!

05:29.662 --> 05:30.330
That's it!

05:30.330 --> 05:33.666
That's it! That's it!
Courage test, that is!

05:33.666 --> 05:35.034
Huh? "Courage test?"

05:35.034 --> 05:37.136
That's right! Courage test!

05:37.136 --> 05:38.671
If this is a courage test,

05:38.671 --> 05:40.707
we should be able to search
for the Crystal Pearl

05:40.707 --> 05:42.575
at close quarters even if
the quality of my finder is bad!

05:42.575 --> 05:43.876
That's right!

05:43.876 --> 05:45.810
Let's do this!

05:46.679 --> 05:49.749
Tada! What do you think?
Does it look good on me?

05:49.749 --> 05:50.950
You look pretty zura!

05:50.950 --> 05:52.518
What the heck are you wearing?

05:52.518 --> 05:54.687
All girls have to wear summer
kimonos for this event.

05:54.687 --> 05:55.822
That's the rule!

05:55.822 --> 05:56.689
Hmm...

05:56.689 --> 05:58.623
It look great on you, Nina-chan.

05:59.258 --> 06:00.350
Th-Thanks.

06:01.194 --> 06:04.597
Which one are you going to confess
your love to? Is it Ichii or Zero?

06:04.597 --> 06:06.699
Which one?

06:06.699 --> 06:09.369
C-Confess my love?

06:09.369 --> 06:12.861
Confessing my love... I...

06:14.374 --> 06:15.375
Huh?

06:15.375 --> 06:17.377
Yes, hello?

06:17.377 --> 06:21.047
Ichii? It's me.

06:21.047 --> 06:23.383
Sarasa? Is this Sarasa?

06:23.383 --> 06:25.885
A girl?

06:25.885 --> 06:30.556
Ichii's got a call from a girl...

06:30.556 --> 06:34.356
Does Ichii... Does Ichii...

06:35.728 --> 06:38.731
Tada! Now I'd like to announce
the opening of our annual

06:38.731 --> 06:41.401
courage test competition
hosted by our class!

06:41.401 --> 06:45.565
First things first, I want everyone
to draw a lot and make a pair!

06:46.406 --> 06:48.741
I want to do the courage test, too!

06:48.741 --> 06:51.077
I swear I'm going to catch
the Crystal Pearl this time!

06:51.077 --> 06:54.247
Ichii-sama! Let's pair up together!

06:54.247 --> 06:56.416
I have come as her guardian as well.

06:56.416 --> 06:58.918
It's amazing you two keep on coming back...

06:58.918 --> 07:04.424
Hey, Nina. Hasn't that guy come
to our class one time before?

07:04.424 --> 07:06.926
I think he's like
Rokka's guardian or something.

07:06.926 --> 07:08.428
I'm Gou.

07:08.428 --> 07:09.429
I'm Gou.

07:09.429 --> 07:10.430
I'm Gou.

07:10.430 --> 07:12.432
I'm Gou.

07:12.432 --> 07:17.270
Oh, he's such a mature man
who's reserved and cool!

07:17.270 --> 07:19.439
He's so dreamy!

07:19.439 --> 07:20.440
What?

07:20.440 --> 07:22.442
Is that your type, Hatsuka?

07:22.442 --> 07:24.444
Surprisingly you're easy
to fall in love, aren't you?

07:24.444 --> 07:25.445
Oh, my gosh!

07:25.445 --> 07:28.114
I... I...

07:28.114 --> 07:29.945
I want to pair up with Gou-san!

07:30.783 --> 07:32.785
So anyway zura!

07:32.785 --> 07:36.448
Yaay! Everyone, let's be happy, okay!

07:41.294 --> 07:43.963
The time has finally come!

07:43.963 --> 07:45.798
We're going to scare the people
who'd be coming this way.

07:45.798 --> 07:47.467
Then make sure the girl is alone

07:47.467 --> 07:49.969
then I'm going to put
the finder against her body

07:49.969 --> 07:52.472
and check and see
if she has the Crystal Pearl.

07:52.472 --> 07:55.308
It's perfect! It's a perfect strategy!

07:55.308 --> 07:58.478
I don't like a strategy like that
because it's not cute!

07:58.478 --> 08:01.814
What do you expect? The finder
is not in working condition!

08:01.814 --> 08:04.317
I can't get any kind of response
unless I get really close to the object!

08:04.317 --> 08:06.319
That's why I told you to get a new one!

08:06.319 --> 08:07.809
Stop complaining!

08:09.655 --> 08:10.823
Here they come!

08:10.823 --> 08:12.492
Here I go!

08:12.492 --> 08:14.827
Oh no... It looks like
there are ghosts in here!

08:14.827 --> 08:16.829
It doesn't just look like it.
They told me they actually are here.

08:16.829 --> 08:18.164
They said they're here!

08:18.164 --> 08:19.499
Waaaargh!!

08:19.499 --> 08:20.500
That's it!

08:20.500 --> 08:22.832
Boo! I'm gonna get you!

08:24.504 --> 08:25.505
G-G-G-Gho...

08:25.505 --> 08:27.507
Gho...

08:27.507 --> 08:31.170
Ichii-sama! Ichii-sama!
Ichii-sama! Ichii-sama! Ichii-sama!

08:32.512 --> 08:36.539
What are you doing? Let it go!
Why are you holding onto me?

08:37.517 --> 08:40.520
I'm scared! Don't do this!
Please don't leave me, Rokka!

08:40.520 --> 08:42.522
Please don't leave me alone!

08:42.522 --> 08:44.524
Get off of me! Get off of me!

08:44.524 --> 08:47.527
Why don't you hang out with ghosts?

08:47.527 --> 08:51.190
You need to wait a million years before
you even thinking about jumping on me!

08:52.031 --> 08:53.366
Ichii-sama!

08:53.366 --> 08:57.537
I'm so scared that I can't even move!

08:57.537 --> 08:59.038
How cruel...

08:59.038 --> 09:00.373
I know what you mean!

09:00.373 --> 09:02.708
You run into a girl like her
every now and then. Don't worry about it.

09:02.708 --> 09:05.711
There are many girls out there
who are better than her in this world.

09:05.711 --> 09:08.214
Don't try to cheer me up!

09:08.214 --> 09:10.614
This is not good!
Let's move on to the next!

09:15.555 --> 09:16.556
Zura...

09:16.556 --> 09:18.547
It's so cute!

09:19.559 --> 09:22.562
What do you think of this?
Boo! I'm gonna get you!

09:22.562 --> 09:24.553
No, please don't flip it up!

09:25.565 --> 09:30.570
I want to be a ghost, too!
Give me this outfit! Give it to me!

09:30.570 --> 09:33.573
Th-Then we'll tell you how to make it
so make one for yourself!

09:33.573 --> 09:36.242
Okay, so tell me how to do the eyes?
Do I use a magic marker?

09:36.242 --> 09:38.578
No, you cut the parts out with scissors.

09:38.578 --> 09:41.914
Then sew them together so that
when you turn it inside out the seam...

09:41.914 --> 09:45.585
Why do we have to teach you
stuff like this anyway?

09:45.585 --> 09:48.588
Because I want to be a ghost, too!

09:48.588 --> 09:49.589
- This is not good!
- This is not good!

09:49.589 --> 09:51.591
Hey, I want to do that, too!

09:51.591 --> 09:56.085
This is not good! This is not good!
Let's move on to the next one!

09:58.264 --> 09:59.265
Umm...

09:59.265 --> 10:00.254
Yes?

10:01.601 --> 10:02.602
Umm...

10:02.602 --> 10:04.103
What is it?

10:04.103 --> 10:06.606
Oh, he is so cool!

10:06.606 --> 10:10.610
I used some tricks on the lots and managed
to pair up with him, but what do I do now?

10:10.610 --> 10:12.778
He's just too cool!
I can't even ask him anything!

10:12.778 --> 10:16.616
No, Hatsuka! Ask him!
Today is the only chance!

10:16.616 --> 10:19.619
Umm, what is your hobby, Gou?

10:19.619 --> 10:20.950
I enjoy bonsai trees.

10:22.955 --> 10:28.450
S-S-So cool! B-Bonsai trees? I...

10:30.630 --> 10:33.121
Boy, this is not good!
Let's move on to the next one!

10:35.801 --> 10:37.166
Ichii...

10:38.638 --> 10:41.630
This courage test
isn't all that scary, huh?

10:42.808 --> 10:44.343
Listen to him...

10:44.343 --> 10:47.313
All I've been thinking about
is the phone call he got earlier...

10:47.313 --> 10:51.317
How am I supposed to enjoy this?
I wonder who that was...

10:51.317 --> 10:53.653
It sounded like he was
very close to that person.

10:53.653 --> 10:54.820
Could it be his girlfriend?

10:54.820 --> 10:56.989
Maybe he has a girlfriend
in the magic world?

10:56.989 --> 10:57.990
Nina-chan?

10:57.990 --> 10:58.658
Huh?

10:58.658 --> 11:01.661
What's the matter? You don't look
like you're enjoying this very much.

11:01.661 --> 11:04.997
What? Oh, it's nothing.

11:04.997 --> 11:07.166
Okay, then that's fine.

11:07.166 --> 11:09.335
Wh-Wh-What should I do?

11:09.335 --> 11:12.672
Since we're alone right now,
I guess it's okay to ask him about it.

11:12.672 --> 11:15.508
Ichii, do you have anyone
that you have feelings for?

11:15.508 --> 11:17.677
What? Anyone I have
feelings for, you said?

11:17.677 --> 11:21.681
Huh? No, I didn't mean
anything serious by it!

11:21.681 --> 11:25.151
Y-You see, some girls in my class
were wondering about it,

11:25.151 --> 11:26.686
so I just wanted to ask you that.

11:26.686 --> 11:28.254
I don't have anyone like that for now.

11:28.254 --> 11:31.691
I guess you could say
I'm currently looking for one.

11:31.691 --> 11:33.693
But how about that girl?

11:33.693 --> 11:35.695
Huh? "That girl"?

11:35.695 --> 11:37.530
Boo!

11:37.530 --> 11:41.193
Boo! I'm gonna get you!
I'm gonna get you!

11:49.709 --> 11:52.371
Oh no... At this rate...

11:53.713 --> 11:58.582
You two! You two! What are you two doing?

11:59.719 --> 12:00.720
Rokka!

12:00.720 --> 12:04.212
I'm scared! I'm scared!
I'm scared! I'm scared!

12:06.058 --> 12:07.393
Fo-chan!

12:07.393 --> 12:09.729
Fo-chan!!

12:09.729 --> 12:12.391
Gho! Gho! Gho! Gho! Ghost!!

12:13.733 --> 12:16.602
Give me a break!
What the hell are you doing?

12:16.602 --> 12:18.404
You're here for the courage test
for god's sake!

12:18.404 --> 12:20.573
M-M-More ghosts!!

12:20.573 --> 12:22.734
We are not ghosts! It's me!

12:23.743 --> 12:25.404
Hey, you two are...

12:27.747 --> 12:29.749
Zero and Ichii?

12:29.749 --> 12:30.916
Nanase and Yakumo!

12:30.916 --> 12:33.586
What? So that means you two are...

12:33.586 --> 12:34.754
That's right! We are!

12:34.754 --> 12:36.255
Examinees!

12:36.255 --> 12:38.086
What?

12:57.610 --> 12:59.111
You two are...

12:59.111 --> 13:02.782
That's right! We are
examinees #007 and #008!

13:02.782 --> 13:03.783
Nanase and!

13:03.783 --> 13:04.950
Yakumo!

13:04.950 --> 13:07.953
We're the examinees, who're aspiring
to become professional sorcerers!

13:07.953 --> 13:10.456
It's been a while since the last time
we ran into these unpleasant faces, huh?

13:10.456 --> 13:11.457
Right back at you!

13:11.457 --> 13:13.626
We didn't think we'd ever have
to look at your idiotic faces, either!

13:13.626 --> 13:16.796
What did you say? You call
my cute face "idiotic"?

13:16.796 --> 13:18.631
We will not let you take the pearl!

13:18.631 --> 13:20.466
What are you talking about?

13:20.466 --> 13:23.636
I promise I'll kick your butts
this time around for sure!

13:23.636 --> 13:28.474
Umm, I guess they know each other,
but it looks like they don't get along...

13:28.474 --> 13:32.478
It doesn't just look that way!
We don't get along!

13:32.478 --> 13:35.481
We're in the same grade
at the sorcery cram school.

13:35.481 --> 13:36.482
Cram school?

13:36.482 --> 13:39.318
Do you learn magic at the cram school?

13:39.318 --> 13:41.821
Well, it's all up to individuals.

13:41.821 --> 13:43.823
At that particular cram school,

13:43.823 --> 13:47.993
we have the sorcery battle once every month
and two people pair up for it.

13:47.993 --> 13:49.995
Every time we fight against each other

13:49.995 --> 13:53.332
it always ends in a draw
so it's never been settled.

13:53.332 --> 13:56.502
Is that why you guys have
a confrontational relationship?

13:56.502 --> 13:59.004
No, that's not all.

13:59.004 --> 14:01.340
And don't tell me you've
forgotten about it, Zero!

14:01.340 --> 14:03.843
What do you mean "that's not all"?

14:03.843 --> 14:07.346
Nanase, just go ahead and tell him!

14:07.346 --> 14:11.851
Tell him what we had to go through
because of them, Nanase!

14:11.851 --> 14:15.187
It's a perfect opportunity!
Just tell them everything!

14:15.187 --> 14:16.522
What is it?

14:16.522 --> 14:19.855
"What they had to go through
because of Zero"? What is it?

14:20.860 --> 14:23.852
That happened three years ago...

14:25.865 --> 14:28.857
It was right after I joined
the sorcery cram school...

14:29.702 --> 14:32.204
Nanase-chan, let me carry your bag!

14:32.204 --> 14:33.539
Thank you.

14:33.539 --> 14:36.041
I'll take you to the place
that you want to go!

14:36.041 --> 14:37.376
Wow!

14:37.376 --> 14:39.879
It feels great to be popular among boys!

14:39.879 --> 14:43.872
Maybe I should never tell them
I'm actually a boy!

14:46.552 --> 14:48.888
Oops, sorry! Are you all right?

14:48.888 --> 14:50.890
What makes you think
she's all right, you brat!

14:50.890 --> 14:52.558
How could you do that to a girl?

14:52.558 --> 14:55.895
Huh? A girl? But that's a boy!

14:55.895 --> 14:57.563
- What? No way!
- What? No way!

14:57.563 --> 14:57.897
- She's a boy?
- She's a boy?

14:57.897 --> 14:59.398
- She's a boy?
- She's a boy?

14:59.398 --> 15:00.900
- A boy?
- A boy?

15:00.900 --> 15:03.903
H-Hey! Wait, Boy A, Boy B and Boy C!

15:03.903 --> 15:07.406
Huh? Boy D, Boy E and Boy F!

15:07.406 --> 15:15.080
And... And my plan to get super popular
at school was brutally shuttered...

15:15.080 --> 15:18.250
Because of this Zero!!

15:18.250 --> 15:21.253
More to the point, I think
that's called a fraud...

15:21.253 --> 15:22.922
That sounds just like Fo-chan!

15:22.922 --> 15:24.089
It's not the same!

15:24.089 --> 15:26.926
And that's not all, right, Ichii?

15:26.926 --> 15:31.096
As you already know, my special technique
is the weaponry magic,

15:31.096 --> 15:32.765
which transforms anything into a weapon!

15:32.765 --> 15:37.269
For instance, a fan like this
can be turned into a weapon!

15:37.269 --> 15:38.930
Check it out!

15:39.939 --> 15:41.273
Awesome!

15:41.273 --> 15:44.944
I'm telling you! That thing
never gets old! I love it!

15:44.944 --> 15:46.278
You think so too, right?

15:46.278 --> 15:49.611
But on the other hand,
at the cram school, Ichii was like...

15:50.616 --> 15:51.947
It's lame.

15:56.622 --> 15:59.614
It's lame... It's lame... It's lame...

16:01.961 --> 16:03.629
Ichii...

16:03.629 --> 16:09.134
Do you have any idea how badly you
stomped on my innocent soul back then?

16:09.134 --> 16:10.970
But I already apologized
for that, didn't I?

16:10.970 --> 16:13.072
No! You just don't get it!

16:13.072 --> 16:18.644
That's so hard to believe that Ichii,
who's always sweet, would say such a thing.

16:18.644 --> 16:21.480
What? Don't you know anything?

16:21.480 --> 16:25.651
He may be quiet now, but back in the day,
in the magic world he was notorious for...

16:25.651 --> 16:26.652
Yakumo!

16:26.652 --> 16:27.987
Anyway I will never
forgive you for that!

16:27.987 --> 16:31.991
I have finally found you!
I'm going to settle this with you today!

16:31.991 --> 16:33.325
Zero! Ichii!

16:33.325 --> 16:35.995
I guess we have no choice.
Let's go, Zero!

16:35.995 --> 16:38.987
Yeah! I'm all ready, Ichii!

16:48.007 --> 16:49.338
Destruction magic!

16:58.017 --> 16:59.678
Fire Ball Piston!

17:00.686 --> 17:04.679
What the?! Curse card magic! Time Slow!

17:07.359 --> 17:09.361
You're moving too slow!

17:09.361 --> 17:11.697
Now is the chance! Take this, Ichii!

17:11.697 --> 17:13.858
My lame weaponry magic!

17:21.040 --> 17:25.044
This isn't good!
Let's get out of here for now!

17:25.044 --> 17:26.375
Come on, Nanase!

17:28.380 --> 17:30.215
We should be fine now that
we've come all the way out here.

17:30.215 --> 17:32.384
But at any rate what should we do now?

17:32.384 --> 17:34.553
When this many people are
after the Crystal Pearl, I...

17:34.553 --> 17:37.056
Hey, let me go! You're hurting my hand.

17:37.056 --> 17:38.887
Huh? What are you talking about, Nana...

17:41.894 --> 17:42.895
Let me go!

17:42.895 --> 17:44.730
Who are you?

17:44.730 --> 17:46.721
Yakumo, you idiot!

17:47.232 --> 17:49.068
N-Nanase?

17:49.068 --> 17:52.404
It was so not cool for you
to leave without me!

17:52.404 --> 17:56.075
And to make the matter even worse
you mistook me for an ugly girl like her!

17:56.075 --> 17:57.743
"U-Ugly"?

17:57.743 --> 18:00.412
Y-You've got the wrong idea, Nanase.
What happened was...

18:00.412 --> 18:03.082
So what, are you telling me
she's the girl

18:03.082 --> 18:05.417
who's swallowed
the Crystal Pearl or something?

18:05.417 --> 18:07.753
She's around here. She's around here.

18:07.753 --> 18:09.088
What?

18:09.088 --> 18:10.089
What?

18:10.089 --> 18:11.090
What?

18:11.090 --> 18:15.094
S-So you're the girl who's
swallowed the Crystal Pearl?

18:15.094 --> 18:18.097
Cripes! I-I'm busted!

18:18.097 --> 18:20.265
I thought that was just a rumor,

18:20.265 --> 18:23.102
but I can't believe an air-headed girl
really does exist, huh?

18:23.102 --> 18:24.436
Sorry for being an airhead!

18:24.436 --> 18:26.605
I see. That explains!

18:26.605 --> 18:29.608
That's why those two were
protecting you, huh?

18:29.608 --> 18:31.443
Wh-What?

18:31.443 --> 18:34.780
Now that I look closer you're
kind of cute! What's your name?

18:34.780 --> 18:36.782
I'm Nina.

18:36.782 --> 18:39.118
Even her name is very cute!

18:39.118 --> 18:40.786
Hey, Nina-chan!

18:40.786 --> 18:44.790
Why don't you kick Ichii and Zero
to the curb and come stay with me?

18:44.790 --> 18:47.960
Until the test is over
I'll be sure to protect you!

18:47.960 --> 18:50.462
I see! So you're thinking
about acquiring the Crystal Pearl

18:50.462 --> 18:51.797
together with the girl, huh?

18:51.797 --> 18:53.632
What makes you think such a thing
is even possible anyway?

18:53.632 --> 18:58.303
Why not? I'm sure it doesn't have
to be Ichii and Zero to protect you!

18:58.303 --> 19:02.141
You may be right, but I...

19:02.141 --> 19:05.878
I swear I'll protect you with my life!
So what do you say, Nina-chan?

19:05.878 --> 19:07.312
Do you want to come stay with me?

19:07.312 --> 19:09.715
You say so, but I...

19:09.715 --> 19:11.546
Hey, there he is! That bastard!

19:12.818 --> 19:14.115
Zero! Ichii!

19:15.154 --> 19:16.655
This is perfect!

19:16.655 --> 19:19.158
This girl who's swallowed
the Crystal Pearl...

19:19.158 --> 19:22.161
Will be protected by us from now on!

19:22.161 --> 19:25.164
What? It is us who are
going to protect Nina!

19:25.164 --> 19:27.166
There's no way we'd hand her over to you!

19:27.166 --> 19:31.303
If that's the case, why don't we
let Nina-chan make a choice herself?

19:31.303 --> 19:34.506
If Nina-chan said she wanted
to come stay with us,

19:34.506 --> 19:38.010
you wouldn't have anything to say
about that, would you, Zero and Ichii?

19:38.010 --> 19:40.679
There's no way Nina would
say such a thing anyway!

19:40.679 --> 19:42.247
You wouldn't know that for sure!

19:42.247 --> 19:45.184
Because I noticed Ichii was
acting awkward towards Nina-chan

19:45.184 --> 19:48.520
during the courage test earlier.

19:48.520 --> 19:51.523
Besides it seems like
Nina-chan knows nothing

19:51.523 --> 19:55.694
about your past or the magic world!

19:55.694 --> 19:57.863
B-But that's...

19:57.863 --> 20:01.767
Zero, Ichii! Are you sure
you two are close to her?

20:01.767 --> 20:05.037
Who knows, you two might
not know anything about her.

20:05.037 --> 20:07.539
If that's how it is we're all
under the same condition!

20:07.539 --> 20:10.709
There would be no surprise if
Nina-chan chose to come stay with us.

20:10.709 --> 20:11.543
You son of a...

20:11.543 --> 20:12.711
Fine!

20:12.711 --> 20:14.046
Ichii?

20:14.046 --> 20:18.217
I wouldn't stop her if Nina-chan herself
wants to go stay with you.

20:18.217 --> 20:21.553
We aren't entitled to stop her anyway!

20:21.553 --> 20:22.888
Ichii, what are you...

20:22.888 --> 20:26.692
All right, I guess it's decided!
Let's test that...

20:26.692 --> 20:28.560
Using this Nina-chan!

20:28.560 --> 20:29.891
What?

20:32.231 --> 20:33.899
Maybe he's got a point.

20:33.899 --> 20:37.769
It is true that I don't know
anything about Ichii or Zero.

20:37.769 --> 20:40.739
Because they were always
around me and protecting me,

20:40.739 --> 20:46.712
I got the idea that I became close
to them and even understood them,

20:46.712 --> 20:49.248
but the truth is that
I don't know anything about them...

20:49.248 --> 20:51.250
I don't know anything...

20:51.250 --> 20:54.253
Sarasa? Is this Sarasa?

20:54.253 --> 20:56.588
I don't have anyone like that for now.

20:56.588 --> 20:59.258
I guess you could say
I'm currently looking for one.

20:59.258 --> 21:02.094
What? Don't you know anything?

21:02.094 --> 21:05.931
He may be quiet now, but back in the day,
in the magic world he was notorious for...

21:05.931 --> 21:07.266
Yakumo!

21:07.266 --> 21:11.603
So... It doesn't matter
if it's Ichii or Yakumo,

21:11.603 --> 21:13.939
it doesn't change the condition, does it?

21:13.939 --> 21:16.601
If that's the case... If that's the case...

21:17.943 --> 21:19.945
Nina! Nina!

21:19.945 --> 21:22.948
If I'm not understanding them,
I'd rather...

21:22.948 --> 21:23.782
What the-

21:23.782 --> 21:25.617
I'll be with Zero and Ichii.

21:25.617 --> 21:28.620
It's true that I don't know anything
about their past and stuff like that,

21:28.620 --> 21:30.789
but I do know that I can trust them.

21:30.789 --> 21:34.960
They told me they'd protect me,
and I do trust those words!

21:34.960 --> 21:37.296
So if the condition is
the same for both of you,

21:37.296 --> 21:39.628
I'd rather choose Zero and Ichii!

21:40.966 --> 21:42.801
I'm sorry!

21:42.801 --> 21:44.462
Zero! Ichii!

21:45.637 --> 21:50.976
I had faith in you, Nina-chan,
that you would definitely pick us.

21:50.976 --> 21:52.644
Ichii! Zero!

21:52.644 --> 21:53.478
Nina.

21:53.478 --> 21:56.315
Please continue
to protect me, Zero, Ichii.

21:56.315 --> 22:01.486
By the way what would you have done if Nina
chose those two instead for real, Ichii?

22:01.486 --> 22:03.655
If it ever comes to
that I will reclaim her.

22:03.655 --> 22:04.489
- What?
- What?

22:04.489 --> 22:07.492
I will reclaim her
even if I have to use force.

22:07.492 --> 22:11.330
Because we're the ones who are
supposed to protect Nina-chan.

22:11.330 --> 22:12.664
Ichii!

22:12.664 --> 22:15.834
Damn it! Now it's come to this
we should use force and...

22:15.834 --> 22:19.171
Don't even try it! They don't even view us
as their worthy opponents right now.

22:19.171 --> 22:27.012
But one day I swear I will make Nina-chan
say she wants to come stay with me!

22:27.012 --> 22:30.849
Oh, Nina-chan! She's such a good girl!
Now I like her even more!

22:30.849 --> 22:31.350
- What?
- What?

22:31.350 --> 22:36.121
Well then, I guess we'll see you later!

22:36.121 --> 22:38.357
I won't give up on
the Crystal Pearl, you hear?

22:38.357 --> 22:41.026
Bye, Nina-chan!
Wait for me until next time!

22:41.026 --> 22:43.695
Zero, Ichii, don't forget
to brush your teeth!

22:43.695 --> 22:45.697
Humph! It'll be the same thing
no matter how many times they come!

22:45.697 --> 22:47.366
- We will protect Nina!
- We will protect Nina!

22:47.366 --> 22:50.202
That's right. My heart
won't change, either...

22:50.202 --> 22:53.705
I might not know much
about Ichii and Zero,

22:53.705 --> 22:57.042
but I still can trust them!

22:57.042 --> 23:02.714
That they will protect me
no matter what. I can trust them!

23:02.714 --> 23:04.383
Shall we go home, Nina-chan?

23:04.383 --> 23:06.051
Yeah!

23:06.051 --> 23:07.382
Zero! Ichii!

23:09.054 --> 23:12.224
It's okay for me to learn
about their past later, right?

23:12.224 --> 23:15.394
Because I still have plenty of time.

23:15.394 --> 23:18.897
It's okay to take time
and get to know about them, right?

23:18.897 --> 23:27.236
It's okay to take time because
my trust for them will never waver.

23:27.739 --> 23:29.574
Umm...

23:29.574 --> 23:31.243
What is it?

23:31.243 --> 23:32.733
What kind of bonsai plant do you like?

23:34.913 --> 23:35.914
Pine tree.

23:35.914 --> 23:38.750
Oh, so nice! Nice! Nice! Nice!

23:38.750 --> 23:40.741
Oh, pine tree!

23:44.423 --> 23:47.259
Pit-a-pat, skip! Parallel pop!

23:47.259 --> 23:50.228
Pit-a-pat, step! Miracle kiss!

23:50.228 --> 23:53.254
Pit-a-pat, magical! Lollipop!

24:02.040 --> 24:07.846
My heart is beating so fast.
He might notice.

24:07.846 --> 24:13.652
My heart is pounding and throbbing.
It feels like it's going to burst.

24:13.652 --> 24:19.524
No matter which direction
I look, his eyes are crystals.

24:19.524 --> 24:25.430
They are so brilliant
that I just look away.

24:25.430 --> 24:31.269
The seed of love has begun to sprout.
Even my magic, too! Check it out!

24:31.269 --> 24:39.744
They will keep on growing
and spinning and explode!

24:39.744 --> 24:45.417
Popping lollipop. Save me, lollipop!
Throbbing heart.

24:45.417 --> 24:51.723
Two candies, I can't decide
which one is better.

24:51.723 --> 24:57.629
Even the earth turns the other way,
if you hold me,

24:57.629 --> 25:03.468
the shape of my heart will change
just like pit-a-pat!

25:03.468 --> 25:09.065
The shape of my heart will change
just like pit-a-pat! Lollipop!

25:13.512 --> 25:16.014
Oh, no! What is this?

25:16.014 --> 25:17.682
What's all the racket, Zero?

25:17.682 --> 25:20.515
Sheesh, what's all this noise?

25:21.520 --> 25:24.523
- Why do I see another me?
- Why do I see another me?

25:24.523 --> 25:25.524
What's going on?

25:25.524 --> 25:27.692
Hey, you! Why are you dressed like that?

25:27.692 --> 25:29.861
That's my line! Don't do lame stuff!

25:29.861 --> 25:31.530
You two, calm down!

25:31.530 --> 25:36.201
Next time on Save Me! Lollipop,
"Nina is Zero and Zero is Nina!"

25:36.201 --> 25:39.136
- Just what happened?
- Just what happened?
